130	/**
131	 * Send an email. Never throws — logs and returns false on failure so callers
132	 * don't break flows. EVERY attempt is written to `EmailLog` (SENT on success,
133	 * FAILED + error otherwise) for the admin Logs viewer.
134	 *
135	 * NOTIFICATION PREFERENCES are enforced HERE, not at the call sites.
136	 * `User.notificationPrefs` was a column the customer edited and nothing read, so
137	 * turning off "email me about billing" changed nothing. Gating each send site
138	 * individually would have fixed today's sites and left every future one to
139	 * re-introduce the bug; gating centrally means a new send site inherits the
140	 * policy automatically and per-site checks become defence in depth.
141	 *
